      "name": "Discovery: ENR eth2 Field (Modified)",
      "description": "Modifies the ENR eth2 field computation for the Fulu fork (EIP-7892). The ENRForkID structure is unchanged but the field value computations are updated. The next_fork_version only changes for regular forks (not BPO forks), while next_fork_epoch accounts for both regular and BPO forks.",
