          "id": "INV-067",
          "text": "fork_digest is compute_fork_digest(genesis_validators_root, epoch) where epoch is the node's current epoch defined by wall-clock time."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-068",
          "text": "next_fork_version is the fork version corresponding to the next planned regular fork (not BPO forks). If no future fork is planned, next_fork_version = current_fork_version."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-069",
          "text": "next_fork_epoch is the epoch at which the next fork (regular OR BPO fork) is planned. If no future fork is planned, next_fork_epoch = FAR_FUTURE_EPOCH."
