      "description": "Defines the new 'nfd' (next fork digest) ENR field that communicates the digest of the next scheduled fork, regardless of whether it is a regular or Blob-Parameters-Only fork. This complements the eth2 ENRForkID for more accurate next-fork detection. Must be added once FULU_FORK_EPOCH is assigned a value other than FAR_FUTURE_EPOCH.",
