          "text": "The nfd field MUST be added to the ENR once FULU_FORK_EPOCH is assigned any value other than FAR_FUTURE_EPOCH."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-073",
          "text": "If no next fork is scheduled, the nfd entry contains the default value (SSZ representation of a zero-filled array)."
